  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ゆびさきを　すりあわせて　しおをケガした　ポケモンに　ふりかけるとひどい　きずも　たちまち　なおる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손끝을 문질러서 나온 소금을 다친 포켓몬에게 뿌리면 심한 상처도 금방 낫는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要合起指尖，搓出鹽來灑在受傷的寶可夢身上，就算再重的傷都會瞬間痊癒。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sel dont il saupoudre les Pokémon blessés en frottant le bout de ses doigts guérit aussitôt toutes les blessures, même les plus graves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es reibt seine Fingerspitzen aneinander, um Salz auf verwundete Pokémon zu streuen. Dieses heilt selbst schwere Verletzungen im Nu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando encuentra a un Pokémon herido, frota las puntas de los dedos para rociarlo con sal y curar rápidamente incluso las heridas más graves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sfrega le dita per cospargere di sale i Pokémon feriti e guarire all’istante anche le lesioni più gravi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Garganacl will rub its fingertips together and sprinkle injured Pokémon with salt. Even severe wounds will promptly heal afterward.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "指先を　擦りあわせて　塩をケガした　ポケモンに　振りかけるとひどい　傷も　たちまち　治る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要它摩擦指尖，搓出盐来撒在受伤的宝可梦身上，无论再重的伤都能瞬间愈合。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando encuentra a un Pokémon herido, frota las puntas de los dedos para rociarlo con sal y curar rápidamente incluso las heridas más graves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ミネラルほうふな　しおを　なめたくてキョジオーンの　まわりに　たくさんのポケモンが　あつまってくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "미네랄이 풍부한 소금을 핥기 위해 콜로솔트의 주위에는 수많은 포켓몬들이 모여든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了舔牠富含礦物質的鹽，鹽石巨靈的周圍總是會有大量的寶可夢聚集而來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nombreux sont les Pokémon qui se rassemblent autour des Gigansel dans l’espoir de pouvoir lécher leur sel riche en minéraux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Viele Pokémon scharen sich um Saltigant, in der Hoffnung, an seinem mineralreichen Salz lecken zu können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muchos Pokémon se arremolinan alrededor de Garganacl para lamer su sal rica en minerales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sono molti i Pokémon che si raccolgono attorno a Garganacl per leccare il suo sale ricchissimo di minerali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
